{"book":"dc","num":114,"verses":[{"en":"Verily thus saith the Lord: It is wisdom in my servant David W. Patten, that he settle up all his business as soon as he possibly can, and make a disposition of his merchandise, that he may perform a mission unto me next spring, in company with others, even twelve including himself, to testify of my name and bear glad tidings unto all the world.","n":1,"sm":"E moni ua faapea ona fetalai mai o le Alii: O le poto i la’u auauna o Tavita W. Patten, ia faamautu e ia ana pisinisi uma i le vave e mafai ai e ia, ma faia se faamatuuga atu o ana oloa, ina ia mafai ona faia e ia se misiona mo a’u i le tau totogo a sau, e faatasi ma isi, e oo lava i le toasefululua e aofia ai ma ia, e molimau atu i lo’u igoa ma folafola atu tala fiafia i le lalolagi atoa.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"verily,","sm":"moni"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"fetalai"},{"en":"thus says","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"of the Lord","sm":"Alii:"},{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the wisdom","sm":"poto"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"la’u"},{"en":"to my servant","sm":"auauna"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of David,","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"W."},{"en":"","sm":"Patten,"},{"en":"that","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faamautu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"his","sm":"ana"},{"en":"","sm":"pisinisi"},{"en":"all","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vave"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"mafai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"faamatuuga"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"his","sm":"ana"},{"en":"","sm":"oloa,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"mafai"},{"en":"that may","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"misio